<title>USA: Texoil Inc closes note purchase agreement.</title>
<headline>Texoil Inc closes note purchase agreement.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texoil Inc said Wednesday its Texoil Co unit had closed on a note purchase agreement with Resource Investors Management Company to provide up to $8 million in two tranches to fund the company's 3-D seismic exploration program.</p>
<p>3-D seismic data acquisition has now been completed over the Raceland Project, the largest of the company's inventory of prospects, a statement from Texoil said.</p>
<p>Interpretation is in progress on a second prospect, and permitting is underway on a third prospect, the company said.</p>
</text>
